{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测启动 ProxyChains。对应需求：代理链隐匿来源。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux执行ProxyChains","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n进程名为 proxychains/proxychains4 或命令行调用该工具。\n\n### 为何重要\n攻击者用代理链隐藏真实出口 IP。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对源/目的地址、端口与是否加密隧道。\n3. 关联同主机前后外连、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://blog.bitsadmin.com/living-off-the-foreign-land-windows-as-offensive-platform"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"4b868f1f-15ff-4ba3-8c11-d5a7a6356d37","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 隧道或外连"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\") and\nprocess.name == \"proxychains\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1090","name":"Proxy","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1090/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1090.003","name":"Multi-hop Proxy","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1090/003/"}]},{"id":"T1572","name":"Protocol Tunneling","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1572/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"false_positives":["渗透测试或合规扫描经授权使用 ProxyChains"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","source.ip","destination.ip","network.direction","message"]},"version":111,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
